<title>USA: Clarendon Hills, Ill., won by Bernardi Sec..</title>
<headline>Clarendon Hills, Ill., won by Bernardi Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Sec. said it won $1.325 million of Clarendon Hills, Ill., installment contract limited tax certificates, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.33 percent.</p>
</text>
